    "28": {
      "date": "2026-10-18",
      "edition": "Sunday 18 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Eligibility watch",
          "heading": "Mark Nawaqanitawase's Fiji switch remains unresolved as Sewabu says FRU is watching",
          "body": "Mark Nawaqanitawase has not yet confirmed his international allegiance. His agent has said the winger is weighing a possible switch of allegiance, and he is eligible for Fiji, Italy and Australia after serving the three-year stand-down. FRU chief executive Koli Sewabu said: \"We are aware of the potential switch Mark could make at the next World Cup and follow this with interest.\" Wallabies coach Les Kiss says he will wait until the end of the year to see where the winger sits."
        },
        {
