          "heading": "Ciaran Frawley scores two tries as Connacht beat Saracens with Farrell watching",
          "body": "Connacht's 45-36 win over Saracens in the Champions Cup put Ciaran Frawley's form squarely in front of Andy Farrell, who watched from the stands. Frawley led from fly-half and scored two tries, and with Jack Crowley currently sidelined, Planet Rugby expects both Connacht stars to be in Ireland's 23 for November."
