          "kicker": "Nations Championship",
          "heading": "Italy still winless after three Nations Championship matches, conceding 131 points",
          "body": "Italy go into Round 4 without a win in three matches, sitting 11 of 12 with three defeats, 37 points scored and 131 conceded, a difference of -94. The most recent result was a 10-57 loss to Australia in Round 3. The next opponent is South Africa, who beat Italy 32-14 at home in November 2025 in an international friendly, a single meeting rather than a head-to-head record."
