          "heading": "Argentina's four-nation 2035 World Cup bid lodged as Spain also bids",
          "body": "Argentina are one of four South American nations to submit a joint bid for the 2035 Rugby World Cup, alongside Uruguay, Chile and Brazil, a submission reported in early October. There is no coverage of a host announcement in today's press. The bid must also contend with what Planet Rugby describes as World Rugby's desire for a European return, and Spain has also bid, with a Nou Camp final featuring in its pitch."
