          "body": "Across their last 11 games, Japan have scored 309 points and conceded 308, averages of 28.1 and 28 a game. Their biggest win in that window was 63-14 at home to USA in September, in the Pacific Nations Cup knockout stage. Their last result was a 15-42 defeat to France in Round 3. They are next due to play Wales in Round 4."
